        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\"><em>近戰武器攻擊：</em>命中</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">+5</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">，觸及</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">尺，單一目標。<em>命中：</em></span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">5</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1d4+3</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">）點鈍擊傷害，外加</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">（</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">1d4</span><span style=\"font-family:'STHeiti light'\">）點穿刺傷害。</span></p><p><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> [[/r 1d20+5]]{+5} to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. <em>Hit:</em> 5 ([[/damage 1d4 + 3 type=bludgeoning]]) damage plus 2 ([[/damage 1d4 type=piercing]]) damage.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
